### Register demo user A (400 "Username is already in use" if it already exists)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "chef_anna",
  "email": "chef.anna@cuisine.test",
  "password": "Demo-Pass-2026",
  "fullName": "Anna Chef"
}

### Register demo user B (used to show 403 on someone else's post)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "chef_ben",
  "email": "chef.ben@cuisine.test",
  "password": "Demo-Pass-2026",
  "fullName": "Ben Chef"
}

### Duplicate username -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "chef_anna",
  "email": "another.anna@cuisine.test",
  "password": "Demo-Pass-2026",
  "fullName": "Another Anna"
}
